        "description": "NXT Event Planner is a modern, flexible theme designed for event organizers, planners, and conference managers. Built with clean code and full compatibility with the latest WordPress standards, it offers responsive layouts that look perfect on all devices. The theme is easy to customize. With easy color and typography controls, users can personalize their site without coding knowledge. NXT Event Planner is optimized for speed, SEO-friendly, and translation-ready, making it suitable for global audiences. Whether you’re managing corporate events, weddings, workshops, or festivals, this theme helps you showcase every detail professionally."
